# Type scale

Two sans families: **Mona Sans** (`font-heading`) for titles and figures, **Schibsted Grotesk** (`font-sans`) for everything else. Do not load a third face for numbers. Do not put Mona on body copy, kickers, posts, empty states, or the site name.

| Role | Face | Size | Example |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Wordmark | Grotesk | `type-wordmark` (`text-xl font-medium tracking-[-0.04em]`) | MarketRegular |
| Kicker | Grotesk | `type-kicker` (`text-sm`) | Toronto, Live posts, When, where, or what |
| Page title | Mona | `h1` (`text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight`) | Toronto farmers' markets |
| Panel / section | Mona | `h2` (`text-2xl leading-tight`) | Find a market |
| Narrow column / day / card | Mona | `h3` or `type-column` (`text-lg leading-tight`) | The group chat from the stalls |
| Lede | Grotesk | `type-lede` (`text-lg`) | Sentence under an h1 |
| How / body | Grotesk | `text-base` | Choose when, a neighbourhood… |
| List names | Grotesk | `text-base font-medium` | Wychwood Barns in a row |
| Times / prices / stalls / census | Mona semibold, condensed | `type-nums` | `8 AM–2 PM`, `39` |

Use real heading tags and let the base sizes apply. Do not add `text-4xl`, `text-5xl`, `text-[13px]`, or `font-heading` on paragraphs. Numbers use `type-nums`, not `font-mono`.

The wordmark is Grotesk on purpose so it does not look like a page title. Nav stays Grotesk `text-sm font-medium`.
